      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Sully Historic Site, once Richard Bland Lee I’s home, preserves an 18th‑century plantation and shows colonial life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
