      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lawrence Park on Route 28 features a historic farmhouse, mill, trails, and athletic fields that echo the area’s rural past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
